#: ../../source/developing/core_architecture.md:6
msgid "Core Architecture"
msgstr "核心架构"

#: ../../source/developing/core_architecture.md:8
msgid ""
"This document introduces the core operating mechanisms of UniSDK, "
"including the startup flow, interrupt management, exception handling, and"
" low-power framework."
msgstr ""
"本文档介绍 UniSDK 的核心运行机制，包括启动流程、中断管理、异常处理和低功耗框架。"

#: ../../source/developing/core_architecture.md:10
msgid "System Startup Flow"
msgstr "系统启动流程"

#: ../../source/developing/core_architecture.md:12
msgid ""
"The startup process of UniSDK begins from hardware reset and goes through"
" the following stages:"
msgstr ""
"UniSDK 的启动过程从硬件复位开始，经过以下阶段："

#: ../../source/developing/core_architecture.md:25
msgid "Stage Descriptions"
msgstr "阶段说明"

#: ../../source/developing/core_architecture.md:27
msgid ""
"**`cstartup_flash.S`** — Assembly startup code, sets up the stack, copies"
" the data segment, zeros BSS, jumps to the C entry point"
msgstr ""
"**`cstartup_flash.S`** — 汇编启动代码，设置堆栈、复制数据段、清零 BSS、跳转到 C 语言入口点"

#: ../../source/developing/core_architecture.md:28
msgid ""
"**`tlk_init()`** — SDK initialization function, initializes each "
"subsystem in sequence"
msgstr ""
"**`tlk_init()`** — SDK 初始化函数，按顺序初始化各个子系统"

#: ../../source/developing/core_architecture.md:29
msgid "**`tlk_loop()`** — Main event loop, handles BLE events, timers, etc."
msgstr ""
"**`tlk_loop()`** — 主事件循环，处理 BLE 事件、定时器等"

